    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Self Cultivation of the Strong &quot;is a combination of developing a world map, third person survival shooting, and Roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without a woman in my heart, drawing a sword naturally becomes divine. To become a true powerhouse, one must pass the test of girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest hero of the empire, are you ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique open world map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931970/extras/bb26690c76bbfb01a3e399872062f58e.avif?t=1753232620\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person shooter with Roguelike, breaking through traditional gameplay to bring you a more fun experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931970/extras/983b31c020c3a1b047fde8395dc1af75.avif?t=1753232620\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elites have unique attack mechanisms, and every attack brings a deadly sense of crisis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931970/extras/a34c7898a1eb75bdd48aba28b9edf0b9.avif?t=1753232620\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random skill upgrade combinations bring unique surprises to every step of growth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2931970/extras/d844acc8e9859075bf0013e1cad5b5d5.avif?t=1753232620\" data-ha